IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-interpretation`
IMPORT `g7-vintages`

-- g7-tests-vintages: the resolver from a day or an instant to a version of the text, and what each version says (Minister, Comptroller, paragraph (ba), the Dormant Bank Accounts openings).
-- Every expected value was decided from the Table of Legislation History and the amending instruments (inputs/amending/) before this module was run.
-- The days tested are the day before, the day, and the day after every change; 27 February 2024 is tested at 08:00, 09:29:59, 09:30:00 and 10:00 Jersey time (R&O.10/2024 Article 5).

§ `Endnotes -- tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

`fav` MEANS `the favoured interpretation`
`other F7.1` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.1`
`other F7.2` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.2`
`other F7.11` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.11`

-- An instant in Jersey local time.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      mo IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      mi IS A NUMBER
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATETIME
`an instant in Jersey` y mo d h mi s MEANS
    DATETIME_FROM_DTZ (YMD y mo d) (TIME_FROM_HMS h mi s) "Europe/Jersey"

-- An instant in Coordinated Universal Time.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      mo IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      mi IS A NUMBER
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATETIME
`an instant in UTC` y mo d h mi s MEANS
    DATETIME_FROM_DTZ (YMD y mo d) (TIME_FROM_HMS h mi s) "Etc/UTC"

-- The identifiers of a list of amending instruments.
GIVEN instruments IS A LIST OF `Amending instrument`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`the identifiers of` instruments MEANS
    map (GIVEN i YIELD i's identifier) instruments

