§§ `"comes into force 7 days after it is made" (F7.2): the three Orders and the Table`

-- R&O.28/2023 made 5 April 2023, R&O.56/2025 made 9 October 2025, R&O.102/2026 made 25 September 2026: the Table gives 12 April 2023, 16 October 2025, 2 October 2026.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2023 4 5) `fav` EQUALS YMD 2023 4 12
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2025 10 9) `fav` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 16
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2026 9 25) `fav` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 2
-- The other reading (seven clear days) gives the eighth day, which is not the Table's date for any of the three.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2023 4 5) `other F7.2` EQUALS YMD 2023 4 13
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2025 10 9) `other F7.2` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 17
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2026 9 25) `other F7.2` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 3
#ASSERT NOT (`Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2025 10 9) `other F7.2` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 16)
-- Month ends: made 28 February 2026 comes into force on 7 March 2026; made 25 December 2026 on 1 January 2027.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2026 2 28) `fav` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 7
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2026 12 25) `fav` EQUALS YMD 2027 1 1
-- The reading taken, applied through the instruments' own data, reproduces the Table: the version of 12 April 2023 begins on that day and not the day before.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2023 4 11) `fav` EQUALS `the text of 2 March 2021`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2023 4 12) `fav` EQUALS `the text of 12 April 2023`
-- Under the other reading of F7.2 the three Orders take effect a day later than the Table says: 12 April 2023 is still the old text, 13 April the new.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2023 4 12) `other F7.2` EQUALS `the text of 2 March 2021`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2023 4 13) `other F7.2` EQUALS `the text of 12 April 2023`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2025 10 16) `other F7.2` EQUALS `the text of 27 February 2024`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `other F7.2` EQUALS `the text of 16 October 2025`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the vintage of the text on` (YMD 2026 10 3) `other F7.2` EQUALS `the text of 2 October 2026`

